In order to construct the thimbles, start by labeling the critical points of the potential $V$ as\footnote{In order to avoid notational confusion, we shall denote the critical points with a subscript $\{ i,j,... \}$, and the coordinate vector index, whenever present, with a superscript $\{ a,b,... \}$.} $\boldsymbol{z}^*_i$ with $i \in \{ 1, 2, \dots, N \}$; satisfying

